The '''Durango Zoo''' is a public open-air zoo with fenced enclosures for animals located on the northern banks of [[Lakeshore]]. It is a place where people can see the wild animals of [[Sacred Grove]] such as bears, antelopes, and more. The zookeeper of Durango Zoo is Sam Durango.

